{"type": "item.completed", "item": {"id": "item_145", "type": "agent_message", "text": "The nested list-marker action is a second distinct reproducible issue: on `Indent.md`, tapping Unordered list on the indented child repeatedly adds markers. Both reports were confirmed and logged. I’ve also checked the broader toolbar actions (including selected text, undo, line operations, and date insertion) and confirmed their temporary edits can be reversed; the preloaded files remain unsaved. I’m restoring the changed settings now and doing a final browser state check."}}
